1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,340
天呐 娘亲啊
Oh, my god. Mom.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:03,820
派对就在离家不远处
The party is like around the block.

3
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:04,860
我就出去两小时
I'll be gone for two hours.

4
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,936
那可是两小时啊 能用来学多少东西啊
Yeah. That is two hours you could've spent studying.

5
00:00:06,936 --> 00:00:08,920
我整个周末都在看书看书看书
I had been studying all weekend.

6
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,260
没有和人出去玩 没有和人打电话
No friends, no phone.

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,780
跟一堆书在一起 我快成寂寞姐了
Just me, alone with books.

8
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,020
我快成艾丽克斯第二了
I feel like Alex.

9
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,680
有书作陪 寂寞都是浮云
You're never alone when you have books.

10
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,080
真的吗 你想让我变成那副样子吗
Really? Is that what you want me to turn into?

11
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,460
乖 听我讲 你都高考临头了
Sweetheart, listen to me. This is the SATs, okay?

12
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:21,580
不是小打小闹的科学小测验
It is not some stupid science quiz.

13
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,300
嘿 如果科学小测验是小打小闹
Hey, if science quizzes are so stupid,

14
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,760
你们还把我的高分试卷贴到冰箱上显摆
Why do you put mine up on the refrigerator?

15
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,260
那是因为我们觉得你很可怜
Because we feel sorry for you,

16
00:00:26,296 --> 00:00:27,500
只有书和你做朋友
'cause books are your friends.

17
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,060
她昨晚根本没在看书
Yeah, she wasn't studying last night.

18
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,302
她一直和人视频聊天来着
She was video-chatting the whole time.

19
00:00:31,302 --> 00:00:32,839
-闭嘴 - 我就知道你会这样
- Shut up! - I knew it.

20
00:00:32,839 --> 00:00:33,791
-我就知道 -你居然打我小报告
- I knew it. - You are such a tattletale!

21
00:00:33,821 --> 00:00:35,140
孩子们 不要吵了 我想
Girls, take it down a notch, because I ...

22
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,260
哇 哇 哇
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

23
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,180
我们家三个女人这唱的又是哪出戏啊
What's the hot topic on "The View" today, ladies?

24
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,500
老爸 能不能劳烦你劝劝老妈
Dad, can you just please tell mom

25
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,600
放我两小时假 让我去参加个派对
that I can take a two-hour break and go to a party?

26
00:00:43,709 --> 00:00:45,914
不好意思 美女 我才不想趟这浑水
No, ma'am. I'm not stepping into that one.

27
00:00:45,914 --> 00:00:47,338
别拉我跟你老妈对着干
We're not playing good cop/mom.

28
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,960
来了
I got it.

29
00:00:52,069 --> 00:00:54,060
-你好 -是你叫的水管工么
- Hello. - You call for a plumber?

30
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,100
呃 没有 我们没叫
Uh, no, we did not.

31
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,760
别 别 我们叫了 叫了
Oh, yes, We did, we did.

32
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,540
水管工 你好
Plumber, hi. Yeah.

33
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:00,660
出问题的管道就在楼上 谢谢了
Um, it's right up at the top of the stairs. Thank you.

34
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,507
有必要吗 克莱尔
Really, Claire?

35
00:01:01,991 --> 00:01:03,057
难道我没跟你讲过我会修浴缸吗
But didn't I tell you I'd fix the tub?

36
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:03,860
是的 亲爱的 你讲过
Yes, honey, you did.

37
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,480
当年我还怀着卢克的时候你就承诺过
And I think I was pregnant with Luke at the time.

38
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,580
这么说可不公平
That is not fair.

39
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:09,020
在家里你叫我干啥我就干啥
I've done everything you've asked me to do around here.

40
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:11,820
我都把楼梯修好了 不是吗 看看多结实
I fixed the step, didn't I? Look how solid it is!

41
00:01:12,220 --> 00:01:13,220
我可以在上面像秀兰·邓波尔
I'm like Shirley Temple

42
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:14,320
和那个黑人小伙一样跳舞
and that black guy!

43
00:01:14,383 --> 00:01:15,906
那黑人小伙叫比尔·罗宾逊
Bill "Bojangles" Robinson.

44
00:01:15,948 --> 00:01:17,158
对 就是比尔·罗宾逊
Bill "Bojangles" Robinson!

45
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,020
我先说的
I said it first!

46
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:19,900
就是这里出问题了
So, this is the problem.

47
00:01:20,340 --> 00:01:21,620
水龙头一直在漏水
Uh, faucet just keeps leaking.

48
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:23,000
对的 垫圈裂了
Yeah, it's a cracked washer --

49
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:24,320
我清楚得很
If I know my washers.

50
00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:26,220
一直在滴滴答答滴水
And it's, uh, it's been leaking a little water.

51
00:01:26,264 --> 00:01:28,581
恩 很可能是垫圈裂了
Yeah, could be a washer,

52
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,700
也搞不好是阀门或者是水管裂了
a cracked valve, a stripped pipe.

53
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:33,100
我觉得虽然我不是专业水管工
Well, I guess I'm not a professional plumber,

54
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,160
但我在那浴缸呆过很长时间
but I have spent a huge amount of time in that tub.

55
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:36,980
我可以从从经验上
I can tell you from experience,

56
00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:38,280
至少是躺在里面的感觉....
or at least what it feels like in there --

57
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:57,820
嗷 太好了 你回来了
Oh, good. You're back.

58
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,200
你说我是扮成
I need you to help settle a spat

59
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,940
小铁匠还是扫烟囱的人呢
between our blacksmith and the chimney sweep.

60
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:03,500
淡定 我花了20分钟才找到这件拉风的斗篷
Be nice. It took me 20 minutes to find my opera cloak.

61
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:05,500
还是难以置信 你根本不必租这些的啊
I still can't believe. You didn't have to rent any of that.

62
00:02:05,580 --> 00:02:05,960
拜托
Oh, please.

63
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,620
你知道它们有多物超所值吗
Do you know how many times this has paid for itself?

64
00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:08,320
是吗
Has it?

65
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:09,620
我们的老朋友佩珀
Well, our friend Pepper

66
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,100
很喜欢开主题派对
loves to throw theme parties.

67
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:12,300
是的 他超爱
Yes, he does,

68
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:14,120
本周末是他的首次年度
And this weekend is his first annual

69
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,920
"奥斯卡·王尔德疯狂餐会"
"Oscar Wilde and Crazy Brunch."

70
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:17,100
我们还没恢复元气呢
We're still recovering

71
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,580
他上次的主题烧烤会可把我们雷的不轻
from his "Studio 54th of July" barbecue.

72
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:21,100
一开始这些主题派对还是很有趣的
They were fun at first.

73
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,780
但是后来就变成了个负担
But they have become a lot of work.

74
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:24,780
你必须换装
You have to dress in costume.

75
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:26,600
还必须玩角色扮演
You have to assume a character.

76
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:29,060
我 我真不敢相信你居然跟他约会过
I -- I can't believe you ever dated him.

77
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:29,900
就一次
One date.

78
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,900
都上世纪的事儿了
It was the '90s.

79
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:32,660
当时戴安娜王妃刚刚去世
We'd just lost Princess Di.

80
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:34,540
我觉得世界天崩地裂
I was at sea.

81
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,400
嗷 小卡 我们能不能
Oh, Cam, can we just...

82
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:38,780
我们能不能不要去啦
Can we please cancel?

83
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,920
人家也不想去呀
I wish we could.

84
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:42,560
但是他还怨念着我们逾越节那次没有去
But you know he's still mad at us for missing Passover.

85
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,720
好吧 我懂的
Oh. Right.

86
00:02:43,756 --> 00:02:45,113
"逾越节狂欢夜"那次吗
"Seder-day night Fever"?

87
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:46,700
去换身衣服 往脸上扑点儿香粉
Just go get dressed and powdered.

88
00:02:46,748 --> 00:02:47,652
噢
Ohh.

89
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:49,180
佩珀完成了不可能完成的任务
Pepper has done the impossible!

90
00:02:49,660 --> 00:02:51,580
他成功让俩基佬开始厌恶早午餐
He's made two gay men hate brunch.

91
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,560
你不如直接
You know, it might be easier

92
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,280
把浓缩咖啡倒到糖罐里
just to pour the espresso right in the sugar.

93
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:02,920
天天唠叨
Every morning.

94
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:04,720
杰 你怎么穿成这样
Jay, what are you wearing?

95
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,080
你不能这样去教堂
You can't go to church like that.

96
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:08,109
那就甭去了 我待会儿打高尔夫去
Well, that settles it, then. I'm going golfing.

97
00:03:08,109 --> 00:03:09,478
你又要逃避做礼拜
You're gonna miss church again?

98
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:10,620
上个礼拜天
Last sunday,

99
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:12,100
你说你要去办公室
you said that you had to go to the office.

100
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:14,200
上上个礼拜 你说你要去和朋友吃早饭
The week before, you had breakfast with a friend.

101
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:16,280
上上上个礼拜 你觉得你感冒了
And before that, you thought you had a cold.

102
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,760
结果压根儿不是感冒
That turned out not to be a cold.

103
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,640
那是因为我休养好了
Because I babied it.

104
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,180
你不用跟我们废话
You don't have to convince us.

105
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:22,220
-你跟他讲去 谁 -上帝吗
- You have to convince him. - Who, god?

106
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:24,320
-他老人家是我铁哥们儿呢 -你怎么知道
- Me and god are good! - How would you know?

107
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:26,740
听着 你在教堂里感知上帝 这很好
Look, you feel god in church, which is great.

108
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,220
但我从自然中感知上帝 大自然也是上帝的杰作
I feel god out in nature, amongst his works.

109
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:30,980
你下个礼拜会去教堂吗
Are you gonna go to church next week?

110
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:31,520
看情况吧
We'll see.

111
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,220
那就是说不去咯
I know what "we'll see" means.

112
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,220
如果你再也不想去了 就勇敢说出来嘛
If you're done with church, just say it.

113
00:03:35,296 --> 00:03:36,735
-我再也不会去教堂了 -闭嘴 不要乱说
- I'm done with church. - Don't say that!

114
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,100
听着 我不会再去教堂了
Look -- I'm not going to church anymore.

115
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,060
又不是什么世界末日
It's not the end of the world.

116
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:41,840
别搁这事上小题大做
Let's not make a big deal out --

117
00:03:42,381 --> 00:03:43,401
靠
Hell...

118
00:03:43,401 --> 00:03:44,740
啊 啊 地震了
Aah. Aah. Earthquake!

119
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:45,180
地震啦
Terremoto!

120
00:03:45,215 --> 00:03:46,985
我们走 我们走 曼尼 走 杰
Vamos, vamos, Manny! Vamos, Jay!

121
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:47,840
快点 杰
Come on, Jay!

122
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:49,620
孩子们
Girls?!

123
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:51,860
噢 神啊 神啊
Oh, god. Oh, god.

124
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,440
完了
Okay.

125
00:03:52,922 --> 00:03:54,751
这边 门卡住了
This is -- this is stuck!

126
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:58,400
我们会死在这的 会死滴
We're gonna die! we're gonna die!

127
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,280
最好别
We better not.

128
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,420
如果人们发现我们死时穿成这样儿
If they find us in these outfits,

129
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:01,854
又得有人借机攻击同志群体了
it's gonna be very bad for the gays.

130
00:04:03,028 --> 00:04:04,939
-克莱尔 -我们没事
- Clair - We're okay!

131
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,420
-爸 -卢克
- Dad? - Luke!

132
00:04:07,460 --> 00:04:07,900
宝贝儿子
Buddy.

133
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,200
你没事吧
You okay?

134
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:12,380
那东西差点砸到我
That thing almost fell on me!

135
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,380
我刚就坐那儿
I was sitting there,

136
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:15,060
差这么点砸到我脑袋
and it came this close to my head!

137
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:16,837
好了 你没事了
It's all right. You're okay.

138
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:17,720
你没受伤
You didn't get hurt.

139
00:04:18,020 --> 00:04:20,320
我可不想在这儿等着被受伤呢
Well, I'm not gonna wait around here until I do.

140
00:04:21,306 --> 00:04:22,172
哎...呀呀
O... kay.

141
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:22,680
直挺挺地倒下了
Wow!

142
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,500
痛痛飞 痛痛飞
That is a doozy.

143
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:30,280
你们没事吧
Hey, are you guys okay?

144
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,960
我们没事 你们呢
Yeah, we're fine. You?

145
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:32,840
没事
We're fine.

146
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,680
那真是...
That was really...

147
00:04:34,220 --> 00:04:35,260
稍等
Oh, wait. Hold on.

148
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:36,460
喂
Hello?

149
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:37,720
米奇 你们没事吧
Mitch, are you okay?

150
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:39,180
没事 我们没事
We're okay. We're okay.

151
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,320
菲尔和克莱尔呢
And Phil and Claire?

152
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,800
我刚正跟他们通话呢
Uh, I'm on the other line with them right now.

153
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,260
稍等
One second.

154
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:43,800
喂
Hello?

155
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:45,860
见鬼 菲尔挂了
Oh, shoot, we lost Phil.

156
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,160
菲尔挂了吗
We lost Phil?!

157
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:48,440
菲尔挂了?
We lost Phil?

158
00:04:48,505 --> 00:04:49,920
喂
Hello?

159
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,240
这可好 歌洛莉亚也没了
Great. Now Gloria's gone.

160
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,540
歌洛莉亚也魂归西天了?
Gloria's gone, too?

161
00:04:54,575 --> 00:04:55,700
天啊
Ohh!

162
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:56,320
嘿 歌洛莉亚
Hey, Gloria.

163
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:58,540
感谢上帝 菲尔 你还活着
Ay, dios meo, Phil, you're alive!

164
00:04:58,540 --> 00:04:59,920
我当然没死
Yeah, of course I'm alive.

165
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,400
暂时而已
For now.

166
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,780
几个月来 克莱尔一直咬着我不放
For months, Claire has been after me

167
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:08,300
喋喋不休
and dogging me

168
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,440
"把储藏柜固定到墙上"
"Anchor the cabinet to the wall."

169
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,600
"要是地震了怎么办"
"What if we have an earthquake?"

170
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:13,120
"屋里可有孩子"
"We've got kids in the house."

171
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:13,800
废话不断
Blah blah blah.

172
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:16,960
最终我被逼无奈
So it finally reached the point where I had no choice,

173
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:19,880
只能挽起袖子 骗她说我搞定了
but to just roll up my sleeves and tell her I did it.

174
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:24,760
菲尔
Phil!

175
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,420
老爸 上这来
Dad, get up here!

176
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:29,127
来了 开什么玩笑 我刚修好的
On my way -- seriously, I just fixed that!

177
00:05:29,178 --> 00:05:30,149
哈利
Haley...

178
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:30,720
怎么回事
What's wrong?

179
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,940
老妈被困在里面了
Mom's stuck!

180
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:34,980
你们在里面还好吧
You okay in there?

181
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:35,780
我们没事
We're fine.

182
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,320
门卡住了
The door is jammed.

183
00:05:39,168 --> 00:05:43,201
-那我们一起用力 -好的
- Uh...well, let's -- let's try this together, okay? - Okay.

184
00:05:43,201 --> 00:05:44,760
我推 你拉
Um, I'm gonna push, you pull.

185
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,360
行 数三声
Okay. On three.

186
00:05:49,761 --> 00:05:51,303
不管用
Aah! nothing!

187
00:05:51,346 --> 00:05:53,088
该死
Oh, damn!

188
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,000
其实是这样的
Okay, here's the thing.

189
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,980
我可没推 相反我有点往外拉
I wasn't pushing. In fact, I was pulling a little.

190
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,220
我深知
It dawned on me

191
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:58,600
只要克莱尔困在浴室里
that as long as Claire was stuck in the bathroom,

192
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:00,320
我就有时间把储藏柜固定到墙上
I'd have time to anchor the cabinet to the wall.

193
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:01,860
可以这样说
It's like they say

194
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,400
有时 上帝关上了一道门
sometimes when god closes a door,

195
00:06:03,820 --> 00:06:06,980
他故意关紧 这样你老婆就出不来
he closes it so hard that your wife can't get out.

196
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,820
别慌 我会救你出来
So, don't panic! I'm gonna get you out!

197
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,120
我去拿点工具
I'm just gonna go get some tools!

198
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,920
用铁橇吧 假设你有的话
Get a crowbar if you have one!

199
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,480
你那话什么意思
What is that supposed to mean?

200
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:16,560
说我是个连铁撬都没有的孬白脸是吧
Like I'm some dandy who doesn't have a crowbar?

201
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,420
这可是你自己说的
Well, you did just use the word "dandy."

202
00:06:19,220 --> 00:06:22,100
"孬白脸"可是15世纪的矿工所创作的词
"dandy" is a term coined by miners in the 15th century.

203
00:06:22,125 --> 00:06:22,675
菲尔
Phil?

204
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,560
少废话 把我们弄出去
Just get us out of here.

205
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:28,700
老爸 把她弄出来要多长时间
Dad, how long is it gonna take to get her out of there?

206
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:29,460
非常久
Long time.

207
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:31,780
宝贝们 别担心
Oh, honey. Don't worry.

208
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:33,880
妈妈会很快出来 别紧张
Mommy is gonna be out soon. Don't panic.

209
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:35,900
慢着
Wait a minute.

210
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,720
站住 死丫头 你别想趁机溜去派对
Wait a minute. You're not going to that party, young lady.

211
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:40,000
不 我没想去派对
No, I'm not going to the party.

212
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,120
我只是下楼罢了
I'm just going downstairs.

213
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:42,880
下楼还背包
With your purse?

214
00:06:43,220 --> 00:06:43,860
拜托
Come on.

215
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:46,258
就这次为我掩护下
Just cover for me this one time, and I...

216
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,700
以后你想去哪 姐都开车送
I'll drive you wherever you want.

217
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:50,960
我想去"宽容博物馆"
I want to go to the Museum of Tolerance.

218
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,200
行 宽容嘛 有什么难的
Fine. How far is Tolerance?

219
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:55,800
你们的诡计 我听的清清楚楚
I can hear the two of you scheming out there!

220
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,180
有本事你离开家试试看
Don't you dare leave this house!

221
00:06:57,400 --> 00:07:00,340
你简直就是一个疯婆娘
Ohh, why do you have to be such a psycho control freak?!

222
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:01,180
行啊 给我听着
Okay, you know what?

223
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:03,120
就冲那句 我关你一礼拜紧闭
Just for that, you are grounded one week!

224
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,820
真是教导有方
Oh, that's good parenting!

225
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,500
有你的 两个礼拜
Okay. Two weeks.

226
00:07:06,580 --> 00:07:08,200
还想翻倍吗 接着说啊
Want to double it?! keep talking!

227
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:10,140
啦啦啦啦啦
Blah blah blah blah blah!

228
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:12,545
行 四个礼拜 四！！
Fine! four weeks! four!

229
00:07:12,545 --> 00:07:14,980
接着翻啊 干脆十个礼拜算了
Double it again and make it 10 weeks!

230
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:16,160
天啊
Oh, my god!

231
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,220
瞧你蠢的 再怎么翻也翻不到十倍吧
Do you not hear how much you need to study?!

232
00:07:19,115 --> 00:07:21,296
米奇尔 快点 我们要迟到了
Mitchell, come on. We're gonna be late.

233
00:07:21,307 --> 00:07:22,922
真不敢相信还是要去
Ohh, I can't believe we have to do this.

234
00:07:23,020 --> 00:07:23,960
拜托 地震之后
Come on, after the earthquake,

235
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:26,200
大家都这样打扮不是挺好的吗
it might be nice to be around similarly dressed people.

236
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,600
简直毫无... 哦对了 地震
That makes no... the earthquake!

237
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,340
没错 没错
Okay. Okay. Yes.

238
00:07:30,540 --> 00:07:32,560
这可是个绝佳借口
Yes. This -- okay. This is the perfect excuse.

239
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,420
为什么 我们有惊无险
Why? We're fine.

240
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,040
确实 但佩珀不知情
Yeah, but Pepper doesn't know that.

241
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:35,980
你只需告知他
You'll just tell him

242
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:37,680
我们要进行灾后重建工作
that we have some damage we have to deal with.

243
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:40,200
-为什么是我 -因为以前都是我放他鸽子
- Why me? - Because I'm the one that always cancels.

244
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:42,400
-喂 -别给我 我不跟他讲
- Hello. - No. Don't hand me that I will not talk to him.

245
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,240
我可不会说谎 拿远点
I'm a bad liar. Do not hand me that.

246
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,368
他现在接通了
He is on the phone right now.

247
00:07:44,368 --> 00:07:44,666
快接 该你上了
Pick up. You are doing it!

248
00:07:44,666 --> 00:07:45,090
我听见人声了 喂
I think somebody's talking. Hello?

249
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:49,660
嗨 佩珀
Hi! Pepper!

250
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,800
嗨 听我说 嗨 嘿
Listen -- hi. Hey.

251
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:54,180
我是卡梅隆 你那边情况怎么样
It's Cameron. How are you doing over there?

252
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:54,680
很好
Great.

253
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:55,920
这地震
Well, the earthquake.

254
00:07:55,974 --> 00:07:57,580
嗯 这边很严重 非常严重
Yeah, it was huge here. Huge.

255
00:07:57,620 --> 00:07:58,880
因而 显然我们
So, obviously, we're not,

256
00:07:58,897 --> 00:08:00,420
我们没法过来了
we're not gonna be able to make it.

257
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:02,360
-为什么 -碎了些餐具
- Why not? - Well, some dishes broke.

258
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,780
可以以后再扫的嘛
You can sweep them up later.

259
00:08:03,798 --> 00:08:05,367
是的 没错 我想
And, uh, well, yeah, I guess --

260
00:08:05,394 --> 00:08:07,464
我想我们是可以以后再扫的
I guess we could sweep those up, um, later.

261
00:08:08,002 --> 00:08:09,880
我们的 我们的衣帽架
Our, uh, our -- our hat rack.

262
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:12,080
-我们的衣帽架倒在窗户上了 -衣帽架
- Our hat rack fell through the window. - Hat rack?

263
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:13,560
是啊 我们真的有个衣帽架的
Well, yeah, we do have a hat rack.

264
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:15,400
我们认为这会迫使我们经常戴帽子
We thought it would force us to wear our hats more.

265
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,040
事实也的确如此
And it did.

266
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,680
我们这里还水漫金山寺
And there's water damage.

267
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:19,100
到处都是水
There's water everywhere.

268
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:21,740
书架砸中了米奇尔的腿
A bookshelf fell on Mitchell's leg.

269
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,080
米奇尔受伤了 佩珀
Mitchell's hurt, Pepper.

270
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,580
米奇尔伤得相当严重
Mitchell's hurt real bad.

271
00:08:24,860 --> 00:08:25,940
我这就过来
I'm coming right over.

272
00:08:26,220 --> 00:08:27,380
不 不劳您大驾了
No, you don't need to come over.

273
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,780
-我马山来 -佩珀 不要
- I'm coming! - Pepper, no!

274
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:31,380
他要过来了
He's coming over.

275
00:08:31,780 --> 00:08:33,260
看见没 人家说了会紧张的嘛
See? Kind of panicked.

276
00:08:33,380 --> 00:08:34,560
你确实很紧张 小卡
You did panic, Cam.

277
00:08:34,589 --> 00:08:35,804
你简直惊慌失措
You paniced real bad.

278
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,480
你还要去打高尔夫吗
You're still going golfing?!

279
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,380
上帝都给你暗示了 杰
God sent you a sign, Jay!

280
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:46,436
什么 地震吗 你开什么玩笑
What, the earthquake? You got to be kidding me.

281
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,880
你说你再也不会去教堂了
You say that you're never going to church again,

282
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,440
接着大地就报复性地晃动
and the ground shakes with a vengeance.

283
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,340
我来证明给你看
I'll prove it to you.

284
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,440
上帝啊 你要是不爽我打高尔夫的话
God, if you have a problem with me golfing,

285
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,460
就给我个暗示
send me a sign!

286
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,940
比如 让闪电劈死我吧
I mean, throw in a little lightning!

287
00:08:56,060 --> 00:08:56,860
小宇宙大爆发吧
Put on a show!

288
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:58,640
不准那样跟上帝讲话
Don't talk to god like that!

289
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:00,780
相信我 要是上帝看我不爽的话
Trust me, if god had a problem with me,

290
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:03,080
他不用摇晃整个城市来警告我
he would let me know without shaking the whole city.

291
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,740
他可以指向更明确一些
He would be a little more specific.

292
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,200
我懒得跟你吵
I'm not gonna argue with you.

293
00:09:06,460 --> 00:09:07,480
我可不想气自己
I don't want to get upset.

294
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,679
曼尼 我们走
Vlmanos, Manny.

295
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:11,520
-我今天想翘一天 - 什么
- I think I'm gonna skip it today. - What?!

296
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,880
我觉得杰说的很对 上帝存在于自然当中
I like what Jay said about god being in nature.

297
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,240
不不不不
No, no, no, no.

298
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,700
别听他滴
Don't listen to him.

299
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,180
他已经时日无多了
His days are numbered!

300
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:20,360
妈妈 想想看 他说的确实有点道理
Think about it, mom. It makes sense.

301
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,260
上帝创造了草木
God made the trees and the grass.

302
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,820
可他并没有盖教堂啊
He didn't make that church.

303
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,820
但是他创造了盖教堂的人
But he made the people that make the church,

304
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:27,920
你让老娘很火大 我们走
and you're making me angry! Vlmanos.

305
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:28,800
就这一周
Just one week.

306
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,120
我能跟你去打高尔夫吗
Can I go golfing with you?

307
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,060
反正我也得找个
Well, I'm probably gonna have

308
00:09:32,060 --> 00:09:33,700
扛球袋的拉丁裔小孩儿
a Latino kid carry my clubs anyway.

309
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:35,460
肥水不流外人田
Might as well be you.

310
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,740
好吧 我才不在乎呢 去吧
Fine! See what I care! go!

311
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,020
曼尼 回去换衣服
Manny. Go change.

312
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:41,860
对不起了 老娘 您大人不记小人过
Sorry, mom. Hope you understand.

313
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:45,120
出去一起玩可能会增进我俩的情感呢
Probably good for us to spend a little time together.

314
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,420
你们一起永不超生去吧
You're gonna spend eternity together!

315
00:09:50,701 --> 00:09:53,137
该死
Ohh. Damn it!

316
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:57,020
我猜那也是上帝干的
I suppose that was god, too!

317
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:59,560
我不知道谁干滴 但是大快人心
I don't know who did it, but it makes me happy.

318
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,340
你干什么呢
What are you doing?

319
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:08,320
哥们儿
Hey, buddy.

320
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,938
我再检查一下这些皮带
Oh, just double-checking these straps.

321
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,720
这条是多余的
This is an extra.

322
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,300
这些小玩意儿救了你的命
These babies saved your life.

323
00:10:12,300 --> 00:10:13,700
因为它们 储藏柜纹丝未动
That's why this cabinet barely moved.

324
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:15,220
柜子直接倒在了沙发上
It fell all the way to the couch.

325
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:16,420
差点砸死我
It almost killed me.

326
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,260
不 不是这样的
No, it didn't.

327
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,440
这储藏柜根本没动
This cabinet barely moved.

328
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:21,060
不过是角度产生的视感错觉罢了
That's just perspective playing tricks on your mind.

329
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,000
从我这个方位看过去 我的拇指比你的头还大
Like if I hold up my thumb, it looks bigger than your head.

330
00:10:23,420 --> 00:10:24,940
不 才没有 它好小
No, it doesn't. It looks tiny.

331
00:10:24,993 --> 00:10:26,217
你得从这边看
You have to look at it from over here.

332
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:28,040
我怎么从那边看我的自己的头
How can I look at my head from over there?

333
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:29,040
菲尔
Phil?

334
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,280
你何不躺下
Why don't you just lie down?

335
00:10:31,293 --> 00:10:32,861
我去确认下你老妈是不是还被困在里面
I got to make sure your mom's still stuck.

336
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:35,720
这样她 我会把她救出来的
So she -- I can get her out.

337
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:37,860
别睡着了
Don't fall asleep.

338
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:42,120
很抱歉耽搁 我日...
Sorry that took -- you filthy...

339
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,400
很抱歉耽搁了这么久
Sorry that took so long!

340
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:46,460
我准备将门把手撬下来 好吗
I'm gonna go ahead and just take off the doorknob, okay?

341
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,120
好的
Okay!

342
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,060
开始了
There we go.

343
00:10:48,131 --> 00:10:50,782
这 该死
That's -- oh, damn!

344
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:51,780
什么 怎么回事
What? What happened?

345
00:10:51,972 --> 00:10:54,011
我拿错螺丝刀了
I, uh, brought the wrong screwdriver,

346
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,300
我马上回来
So I'll be right back!

347
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:57,160
好吧 不过快点 菲尔
All right, but hurry up, Phil!

348
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,680
我尽力而为 克莱尔
Doing my best, Claire!

349
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:01,740
别回她话 小心关你禁闭
Oh, don't talk back, dad! She'll just ground you!

350
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:04,080
三十二个礼拜了 死丫头片子
That's 32 weeks, young lady!

351
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:07,746
我之前说的是十六个礼拜 对吧
I was at 16 before, right?

352
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:08,460
怎么了
What?

353
00:11:09,620 --> 00:11:10,120
没什么
Nothing.

354
00:11:10,780 --> 00:11:13,060
等你有这么个青春期的女儿再来评价我
Don't judge me until you've had a teenage girl.

355
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,400
我有四个
I've had four of them.

356
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,520
天啊 你怎么熬过来的
God, how did you survive that?

357
00:11:17,260 --> 00:11:18,540
女儿还不好对付
Girls were a piece of cake.

358
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,660
让我头疼的是儿子
It was the boy.

359
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:22,480
他脸上的每一个表情
Every look on his face,

360
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,640
他每个愚蠢的决定
every stupid decision he made.

361
00:11:25,100 --> 00:11:28,040
坐在那儿像白痴一样嚼东西
The way he sat there, chewing his food like an idiot.

362
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:31,600
然后我突然明白这孩子为何使我这么抓狂
And then it hit me why this kid drove me so crazy.

363
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:34,500
他就是当年的我
He's me.

364
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,160
那她就更应该听我的话了
Well, all the more reason she should listen to me.

365
00:11:38,220 --> 00:11:40,820
我可以避免她重蹈我的覆辙
I can stop her from making the same mistakes.

366
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:42,460
你当年听妈妈的话吗
Did you listen to your mother?

367
00:11:42,460 --> 00:11:43,638
怎么可能
Ohh, god no.

368
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:45,280
不过 你要知道我是有原因的
But, you know, I had a reason.

369
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:47,460
那女人简直就是个疯婆...
That woman was a psycho control...

370
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:48,740
...娘
freak.

371
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:49,780
老妈
Hey, mom.

372
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:51,560
我给你们弄了些苏打水
I brought you some soda.

373
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:53,060
不过我找不到吸管
But I couldn't find any straws,

374
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:54,620
所以你们得像小猫一样舔着喝
So you'll have to drink it like cats.

375
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:56,680
谢谢你 卢克
Oh! Thank you, Luke!

376
00:11:57,620 --> 00:11:58,800
那是我的心肝宝贝
That's my sweetie.

377
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,320
我本来想给你带酒的
I was going to bring you wine,

378
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:02,040
不过你昨晚把那一大瓶都喝完了
but you finished the big bottle last night.

379
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:03,680
好了 你可以走了
Okay. Off you go.

380
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:06,840
拿好这个 没问题吧 小子
Hold this, will you, kid?

381
00:12:06,856 --> 00:12:07,724
没问题
Sure.

382
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:10,280
以前都是米奇尔给我当球童
You know, Mitchell used to caddy for me.

383
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:13,700
当然 他大多时候是在追蝴蝶
Of course, he spent most of his time chasing butterflies.

384
00:12:13,947 --> 00:12:15,440
我不会那么做的
You won't catch me doing that.

385
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,060
真乖
Good for you.

386
00:12:16,160 --> 00:12:17,300
我害怕蝴蝶
I'm terrified of them.

387
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:17,820
是吗
Huh.

388
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,600
看 那一杆堪称完美
Look at that. That's a perfect shot.

389
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:21,920
我还是用的烂球杆打的
And I hit that with a bent club.

390
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,060
你不担心会惹上麻烦吗
So you're not worried about getting in trouble?

391
00:12:24,060 --> 00:12:25,820
不害怕上帝会找你茬吗
You know, with god?

392
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:27,940
我想他有比这更重要的事要操心
Oh, I think he's got bigger things on his plate.

393
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,820
那你也不担心会下地狱吗
So you're not worried about hell?

394
00:12:32,300 --> 00:12:34,240
告诉你点小秘密 孩子
Let me let you in on a little secret, kid.

395
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,340
世上根本没有地狱
There is no hell.

396
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:36,680
真的吗
Seriously?

397
00:12:37,340 --> 00:12:37,960
没有地狱吗
No hell?

398
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,580
真他妈太棒了
That's fantastic!

399
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:43,620
那所有的人都会去天堂喽
So everyone just goes to heaven?

400
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:44,940
对 这个话题到此为止
Yep. End of story.

401
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,400
连坏人也能去天堂吗
Even bad people?

402
00:12:47,424 --> 00:12:48,670
对 他们 他们坏人
Yeah, they're -- they're --

403
00:12:48,670 --> 00:12:50,140
分配到了别的地方 懂吗
they're in another section, see?

404
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:51,400
上帝都安排好了的
They got this thing figured out.

405
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:52,400
现在我能打了球了吧
Can I hit this?

406
00:12:58,680 --> 00:12:59,460
该死
Damn it.

407
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,380
你让我分心了
You distracted me.

408
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,460
我什么也没说啊
I didn't say anything!

409
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,560
我能听到你内心的想法
I could hear you thinking.

410
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:05,580
我正在想你说的那个
I'm thinking about this heaven of yours

411
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:06,640
到处都是坏人的天堂
that's full of bad people.

412
00:13:06,740 --> 00:13:08,700
不全是坏人 只有很少的一拨人
Not full. The tiniest fraction.

413
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:10,300
他们都被关起来了
They're walled in.

414
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,780
万一他们越狱怎么办
What if they break out?

415
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,220
有一个火焰湖包围他们呢
They're surrounded by a lake of fire.

416
00:13:14,272 --> 00:13:16,980
天堂里竟然还有火焰湖
They are fiery lakes in heaven?

417
00:13:16,980 --> 00:13:18,340
那简直就跟地狱一样了
This is turning into hell.

418
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:22,920
谁说不是呢
Tell me about it.

419
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:28,980
你在干嘛
What are you doing?!

420
00:13:29,260 --> 00:13:30,660
你都告诉佩珀打碎了很多碟子
Well, you promised Pepper broken dishes,

421
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:30,980
所以...
so...

422
00:13:30,980 --> 00:13:31,770
我要打碎这个
I'm breaking this.

423
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,240
不 不要打碎我的青蛙奖杯
No! Not my frog!

424
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:35,800
我知道你觉得这很不入眼
I know you think it's tacky,

425
00:13:35,800 --> 00:13:37,940
但是 这是我第一次参加4-H夏令营
but I happened to have won this at my first 4-H summer camp

426
00:13:37,976 --> 00:13:39,060
在吆喝比赛里偶然得的
in a hollerin' contest.

427
00:13:39,060 --> 00:13:40,560
如果你撒谎撒的好点
Well, we wouldn't have to break anything

428
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:41,700
我们就不用打破这么多东西了
if you were a better liar.

429
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:43,460
如果你是想让我感到愧疚
If you're trying to make me feel bad

430
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:44,940
因为我撒谎撒的没你好
about not being as good a liar as you --

431
00:13:44,980 --> 00:13:45,720
你要干嘛
What are you doing?

432
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,700
你还说衣帽架砸到窗户上了 忘啦
A hat rack fell through the window, remember?

433
00:13:47,735 --> 00:13:50,854
1...2...3
One...Two...Three!

434
00:13:52,980 --> 00:13:53,780
米奇尔 停
Mitchell, wait!

435
00:13:56,099 --> 00:13:58,700
我...我做不到 我退出
I-I-I can't do this. I quit.

436
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:00,060
撒这些谎 你可能觉得没什么
You might be comfortable with all this lying,

437
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:00,700
可我觉得很不舒服
but I'm not.

438
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:03,720
拜托 你别这么装B好吧
Oh, please. Where was all this conscience

439
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,980
那次我可是靠撒谎才把咱俩弄进头等舱的
when I got us into the first-class lounge at the airport

440
00:14:05,980 --> 00:14:07,920
而你却忙着跟安吉拉·兰斯伯里唠嗑
and you chewed Angela Lansbury's ear off.

441
00:14:08,020 --> 00:14:08,820
你知道你是哪种人吗
You know what you are?

442
00:14:09,060 --> 00:14:10,240
你就像是暴徒的老婆
You're like a mob wife.

443
00:14:10,340 --> 00:14:11,900
你看不起自己老公 鄙视他做事的方法
You look down at me and my ways,

444
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,280
但是你却屁颠屁颠地
but you're happy to wear the mink coat

445
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:14,580
乐于坐享其成
that fell off the back of the truck!

446
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:16,400
你竟敢这么说我
How dare you?

447
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,980
不用说了 我知道
I know. I know.

448
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:26,960
真的震得很严重
It really hit us bad.

449
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:27,420
不是
No.

450
00:14:27,540 --> 00:14:30,460
我只是一直都很惊讶 这个地方是有多小啊
I'm just always surprised how small this place is.

451
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,080
佩珀 你没必要离开派对
Pepper, you didn't have to leave your party

452
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,020
特意来看我们
to come check on us.

453
00:14:33,340 --> 00:14:34,800
顺便说一下 戏服真不错
Great costume, by the way.

454
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:36,280
这不是我的戏服
This isn't my costume.

455
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,300
这才不是我的工作服 干苦力时穿的
I just threw this on to help you clean up.

456
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,180
没能去你的派对...
Well, about your party...

457
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:41,660
别心怀愧疚了啦
Oh, don't worry about canceling.

458
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:43,120
至少你们还有个理由
At least you have an excuse.

459
00:14:43,171 --> 00:14:45,170
不像史蒂文和斯蒂芬
Unlike Steven and Stefan.

460
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:46,920
他们说他们感冒了
They said they had the flu.

461
00:14:47,540 --> 00:14:49,940
但刚才我还看见他们骑情侣车出去了
Meantime, I just saw them out riding their bicycle.

462
00:14:49,940 --> 00:14:51,960
佩珀 他们太不厚道了
Oh, Pepper, that is horrible.

463
00:14:52,012 --> 00:14:53,780
我去给你弄杯鸡尾酒
I-I'm gonna make you a cocktail.

464
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:55,620
亲爱的 不用这么麻烦
Oh, honey. Don't go to any trouble.

465
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,753
给我弄杯葡萄干酒就行
I'll just have a Kir Royale.

466
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:58,660
我是说 我的天啊
I mean, my god,

467
00:14:58,660 --> 00:14:59,900
如果他们不想来我的派对
if they didn't want to come to my party,

468
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,860
直接说嘛
just say it.

469
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,760
我是个大人了 我能扛得住
I'm a big boy. I can take it.

470
00:15:03,140 --> 00:15:05,500
既然你提起来了 佩珀...
Well, since you brought it up, Pepper...

471
00:15:06,580 --> 00:15:08,840
其实我们也不想去你的派对
We didn't want to come to your party, either.

472
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:09,660
什么
What?

473
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:12,260
你知道我们是爱你的
Well, you know we love you,

474
00:15:12,260 --> 00:15:15,960
但是这么多年以来 真的成了一种负担
but they've just gotten to be so much work over the years, and...

475
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:16,940
我们没有黑醋栗甜酒了
we're all out of cassis.

476
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:18,440
我受不了了
I can't bear it!

477
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,720
我去给你弄杯贝利尼
I will make you a Bellini.

478
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,760
大家都放我鸽子
Everybody canceled on me!

479
00:15:22,803 --> 00:15:24,410
现在你们两个也这样
And now you two!

480
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:25,920
15年来
For 15 years,

481
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:28,780
我散尽钱财 心力交瘁
I have killed myself setting a community standard

482
00:15:28,822 --> 00:15:31,268
做出各种新奇主题的早午餐
with my fanciful themed brunches

483
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:34,180
给大家制造一个和谐的社区氛围
mounted at great personal expense.

484
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:36,260
很明显 我一直都是个傻帽儿
Well, clearly, I've been a fool.

485
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:38,180
佩珀 没人喜欢你的早午餐
No one likes your brunches, Pepper.

486
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,860
没人待见你
No one likes you.

487
00:15:40,315 --> 00:15:42,624
你会孤独终老
You're gonna die alone!

488
00:15:42,660 --> 00:15:46,540
在棕榈泉外的西班牙复古风中驾鹤西去
In a quaint Spanish revival outside of Palm Springs...

489
00:15:46,576 --> 00:15:48,466
或者奎因塔
Or La Quinta.

490
00:15:50,392 --> 00:15:51,720
我做了回恶人
Yeah. I told him.

491
00:15:51,780 --> 00:15:53,540
恩 看出来了
Yeah. Yeah, I puzzled that out.

492
00:15:56,140 --> 00:15:58,100
我就是不太明白天堂里坏人待的地方
I just don't understand this bad section of heaven.

493
00:15:58,147 --> 00:16:00,245
要是他们把你送错了地方怎么办
What if they send you to the wrong place?

494
00:16:00,280 --> 00:16:02,040
有时候资料会填错
They make mistakes with paperwork sometimes.

495
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:04,820
去年我就被错误安排在女性生理健康课上
I was put in a girls' health class last year

496
00:16:04,820 --> 00:16:06,420
结果看到了非常可怕滴教育片
and had to watch a very disturbing movie.

497
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,080
淡定
Calm down.

498
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,840
整个上午 别再想什么
Instead of thinking all morning

499
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:10,310
天堂应该是什么样儿的啊
about what heaven's gonna look like,

500
00:16:10,349 --> 00:16:13,080
不应该是什么样儿的啊 谁该在哪里啊
what it's not gonna look like, who's where.

501
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,420
如果天堂真的存在的话
If there even is a heaven.

502
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:16,680
我们为什么不专心享受
Why don't we just concentrate

503
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:20,260
我们眼前 又美丽又悠闲的一天呢
on this beautiful, carefree day that's in front of us?

504
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:22,580
我宁愿想想你刚才说的那些
I'd rather concentrate on something you just said.

505
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:24,200
难道天堂真的不存在吗
There might not even be a heaven?

506
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:25,360
我不知道
I don't know!

507
00:16:25,396 --> 00:16:28,176
可是今天早晨你看起来自信满满
You seemed pretty sure of yourself this morning.

508
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,560
那人死了以后会怎么样呢
So what happens after you die?

509
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:30,500
一切都是浮云吗
There's just nothing?

510
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:32,720
听着 我就说了一件小事
Look, you're focusing too much

511
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,320
你却揪着不放到现在
on one little thing that I said.

512
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,680
那些都只是我的直觉好吗
It was just a hunch, okay?

513
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,700
直觉
A hunch?

514
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,940
我没去教堂 就因为你的直觉
I'm skipping church based on a hunch?!

515
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:41,560
好了 不要吓我 孩子
All right, don't freak out on me here, kid.

516
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:44,260
你无耻地玩弄了人家幼小的灵魂...
You're playing pretty fast and loose with my soul.

517
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,740
听着 我要你忘了
Listen. I want you to forget everything

518
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:46,700
我说的一切 好吗
that I said, okay?

519
00:16:46,733 --> 00:16:48,878
杰 有些事情是刻骨铭心的
Some things can't be forgotten, Jay.

520
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:50,540
你知道什么叫月经吗
Do you know what menstruation is?

521
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:52,060
小爷我可一清二楚
Because I do.

522
00:16:59,060 --> 00:16:59,500
搞定
Perfect.

523
00:16:59,538 --> 00:17:01,309
-嘿 -你在干嘛
- Hey! - W-what are you doing?

524
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:02,820
你不是该把老妈从浴室里弄出来吗
Aren't you supposed to be getting mom out of the bathroom?

525
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:03,900
我正是在干这个啊
That is what I was doing.

526
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,440
我正是在干这个啊
That is what I was doing.

527
00:17:05,478 --> 00:17:07,030
这个 这个柜子
This c-- this cabinet...

528
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:09,120
-正是问题所在 -怎么说
- Was the problem. - How?

529
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,520
这个柜子很沉
Yeah. It's very heavy,

530
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:13,300
而且是妥妥地固定在墙上的
and because it was properly anchored to the wall,

531
00:17:13,357 --> 00:17:15,055
所以就有了一些连锁反应
there's sort of a ripple effect.

532
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:15,880
就是说
It was...

533
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,300
它压住了地板的一边
pulling part of the floor down...

534
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:20,640
另一边就被抬起来了
and then pushing part of the floor up,

535
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,400
然后这浴室的门就
using the bathroom door --

536
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,220
拜托别告发我
Please don't tell on me.

537
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:26,100
我不知道我现在是谁了
I don't know who I am anymore!

538
00:17:27,380 --> 00:17:28,200
我是谁
Who am I?!

539
00:17:29,300 --> 00:17:30,460
我就是个笑话
I'm a joke!

540
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:31,560
这就是我
That's who.

541
00:17:31,607 --> 00:17:32,543
-才不是 -不是
- No. - No.

542
00:17:32,580 --> 00:17:33,800
你不是个笑话
You're not a joke.

543
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:35,540
你是佩珀·萨尔茨曼
You're Pepper Saltzman.

544
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:38,140
我觉得我还是走吧
I think I better just go.

545
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,280
就算我在回去的路上发生什么意外
If anything terrible should happen,

546
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:44,020
你们也无须被迫去参加我的追悼会
don't feel an obligation to attend my memorial.

547
00:17:44,061 --> 00:17:47,039
纽约和洛杉矶的都不用参加
New york or L.A..

548
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:47,400
佩珀
Pepper?

549
00:17:47,426 --> 00:17:50,008
佩珀 你都没让我把话说完
Pepper, you -- you didn't let me finish.

550
00:17:50,060 --> 00:17:52,880
我们不想去参加你的派对只是因为
The reason we didn't want to come to your party is...

551
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,640
米奇尔
Mitchell?

552
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:55,480
是不是啊你
Seriously?

553
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:57,700
-谁是暴徒之妻 -是我 是我
- Who's a mob wife? - I'm a mob wife.

554
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:59,060
不好意思 我听不清
I'm sorry. I couldn't hear you.

555
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:00,940
我是暴徒之妻
I'm a mob wife.

556
00:18:01,001 --> 00:18:04,665
好吧 佩珀
Okay, um...Pepper,

557
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,580
这事儿由我开口实在有点尴尬
this is a little embarrassing.

558
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:07,740
我一点都不想听
I don't even want to hear it.

559
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:10,040
卡梅隆对你还是有感觉
Cameron still has feelings for you.

560
00:18:11,580 --> 00:18:12,400
继续忽悠
Go on.

561
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:15,260
只是 只是对他来说很困难
Yeah, and it's just -- it's very hard for him

562
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:18,360
要面对你 尤其还是
to be around you, especially at your...

563
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,720
在你那美妙的早午餐派对 你是
magical brunches where you're just --

564
00:18:20,762 --> 00:18:23,139
你是那么地有魅力
you're -- you're so... magnetic.

565
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:25,940
而且 我看到他深情凝望你的方式
And then I see the way that he looks at you, and...

566
00:18:26,243 --> 00:18:28,243
该死 我都快被醋淹死了！！！
damn it, pe-- it just makes me so mad

567
00:18:28,260 --> 00:18:30,160
我只能...
That I could just...

568
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:32,400
是吗
Really?

569
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:35,240
是呀 你根本不能理解这种情伤 小卡
Yeah, oh, you don't know the pain, Cam!

570
00:18:35,279 --> 00:18:38,061
哦 兄弟们
Ohh, boys!

571
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:41,720
兄弟们 我真的不想当小三
Boys, I can't stand that I'm coming between you!

572
00:18:42,180 --> 00:18:43,800
我就知道我的魅力让人无法忘却
Not that I'm surprised.

573
00:18:44,460 --> 00:18:47,100
我确实注意到你对我暗送秋波
I admit I have noticed the stolen glances

574
00:18:47,100 --> 00:18:48,500
还有你眼中那森森的渴望
and the yearning in your eyes.

575
00:18:49,787 --> 00:18:52,520
如果我们推掉了你以后的早午餐聚会
Okay. Well, y-you'll forgive us, Pepper,

576
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,240
那佩珀你必须原谅我们
if we sit out your next few brunches?

577
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:55,080
当然了
Absolutely.

578
00:18:57,020 --> 00:18:59,340
你们不能来真是太遗憾了
I would hate to lose you two.

579
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:03,220
我会一直把你们当成我的
I've always thought of you as being like my

580
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:04,178
-儿子们 -儿子们
- Sons? - Sons?

581
00:19:04,631 --> 00:19:06,495
什么"儿子们"
"Sons"?

582
00:19:06,820 --> 00:19:08,560
我本来想说"兄弟"来着
I was gonna say "Brothers."

583
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:12,120
这房子简直就是一个大茶几
it's like a house of pain!

584
00:19:13,409 --> 00:19:14,879
-好了 克莱尔 -准备
- All right, Claire. - Okay, ready?

585
00:19:14,913 --> 00:19:15,535
-准备好了吗 -我好了
- You ready? - I'm ready.

586
00:19:15,535 --> 00:19:17,084
-好了 说"开始"我们一起使劲 -好的 开始
- All right, on "Go." - Okay, go.

587
00:19:17,118 --> 00:19:18,215
-好了 开始 -加油 用力
- All right? Go! - Okay, go!

588
00:19:18,249 --> 00:19:19,538
加油 加油
Go! Go!

589
00:19:19,572 --> 00:19:20,974
-克莱尔 -天呐 这门有反应了
- Claire! - Oh, god, I got it!

590
00:19:21,008 --> 00:19:22,557
哦 门开了 门真的开了
Ohh! It's moving! It did it!

591
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:23,760
搞定了 我们做到了
All right! We got it.

592
00:19:23,797 --> 00:19:25,012
-天呐 感谢上帝 -出去吧
- Oh! Thank god! - Go.

593
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:26,640
天呐 真是感谢各路神佛保佑
Oh, thank god. Thank god. Thank god.

594
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:26,940
菲尔
Phil?

595
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:27,980
菲尔
Phil?

596
00:19:28,026 --> 00:19:30,103
亲爱的 菲尔 你跑哪儿去了
Honey -- Phil, where are you?

597
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:30,520
菲尔
Phil...

598
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:33,100
你想害死老娘吗
Are you kidding me?!

599
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,700
饶了我吧 菲尔
Not the -- Phil!

600
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:37,060
-菲尔 -老婆
- Phil! - Hey!

601
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:39,360
你这算怎么回事 人间蒸发了二十分钟
What happened to you? You disappeared for 20 minutes.

602
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:41,520
我们好不容易才从那间浴室出来
We just had to break ourselves out of that bathroom.

603
00:19:41,563 --> 00:19:43,688
你终于出来了 过来抱抱
I am so happy to see you. Get in here.

604
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,260
不要 不要 不要 你给我正经点
Oh, no. No, no. Seriously.

605
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:46,400
到底咋回事
What happened?

606
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,180
老爸刚才忙翻了
Dad was incredible!

607
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:51,560
他忙着关煤气阀门啊
He was running around here turning off the gas line,

608
00:19:51,560 --> 00:19:52,900
清理玻璃渣啊
cleaning up broken glass,

609
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:55,360
在卢克脑袋撞到墙之后照顾他啊
and taking care of Luke after he ran into a wall.

610
00:19:55,381 --> 00:19:56,044
什么
What?

611
00:19:56,060 --> 00:19:59,240
柜子差点倒下来 实在是吓到我了
I got scared because the cabinet didn't fall down.

612
00:20:03,156 --> 00:20:04,092
哦 对不起
Ohh. I'm sorry.

613
00:20:04,102 --> 00:20:05,953
-没事 别介意 -不 是我不好
- Well, don't worry about it. - No, I'm sorry.

614
00:20:05,994 --> 00:20:07,418
我神经过敏了
Oh... I was so nervous.

615
00:20:07,448 --> 00:20:09,340
我刚才给吓坏了
I freaked out.

616
00:20:09,340 --> 00:20:11,320
没关系 没关系
It's all right. It's all right.

617
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:14,060
-这真是个杯具的早晨 -是啊
- I think it was a little bit of a rough morning. - Yes.

618
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:15,340
-是不 -是啊是啊
- Wasn't it? - Yes, it was.

619
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:16,320
你们想干啥我不管
I don't know about you guys,

620
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:18,660
我现在只想翘个二郎腿好好休息一下
but I just want to relax and put my feet up.

621
00:20:18,940 --> 00:20:21,000
去"宽容博物馆"休息更好 谁想跟我一起
At the Museum of Tolerance. Who's in?

622
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:21,740
我呀
I am!

623
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,120
好闺女 咱们走着
You are. Okay. Let's do it.

624
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:28,100
地震并没什么难以理解的
There's nothing mystical about an earthquake.

625
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,280
只是地壳需要释放其累积过大的压力
Pressure builds, and it's released.

626
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:35,440
你只要祈祷没有造成太大伤害就好
And you just hope there's not too much damage.

627
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:40,300
但是地震使你意识到什么最重要
But it makes you realize what matters.

628
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:41,840
对我来说 是我的家人
And for me, that's my family.

629
00:20:42,320 --> 00:20:43,800
我会帮你向上帝美言几句
I'll put in a good word for you.

630
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:44,820
好儿子 你最棒了
You're the best, kid.

631
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:47,527
我的家人和我的高尔夫
My family and golf.

632
00:20:52,540 --> 00:20:53,660
如果天堂真的在天上
If heaven's in the sky,

633
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:54,920
那我们如何立足呢
what do you walk on?

634
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:57,400
曼尼 表犯傻了 当然是腾云驾雾啊
Ay, Manny, don't be ridiculous. The clouds.

635
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:59,560
这说不通啊 云彩只是水蒸气
That makes no sense. Clouds are air.

636
00:20:59,700 --> 00:21:00,820
你会从上面摔下去的
You'd fall right through them.

637
00:21:00,859 --> 00:21:03,584
天堂滴云彩就像蹦床一样
The clouds in heaven -- they're like trampolines.

638
00:21:03,623 --> 00:21:05,221
我可不喜欢蹦床
Mm, I don't like trampolines.

639
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:06,320
我一跳就觉得像晕船
They make me seasick.

640
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:07,840
曼尼 表瞎操心了
Manny, stop worrying.

641
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:09,460
天堂可是灰常美丽滴
Heaven is a beautiful place

642
00:21:09,460 --> 00:21:13,220
有阳光 有彩虹 还有蝴蝶翩翩起舞
with sunshine and rainbows and butterflies.

643
00:21:13,250 --> 00:21:14,450
-神马 有蝴蝶 -哎 米有米有米有
- Butterflies?! -Ay, no, no, no, no.

644
00:21:14,450 --> 00:21:18,260
偶没说蝴蝶 曼尼 那里米有蝴蝶
Aah! I didn't say butterflies! Manny, there's no butterflies!
